{
  PresetMetadata:{
    author:"Kaworru",
    category:"Quest",
    created:1782518400000L,
    description:"A simple skywatcher preset that uses time-of-day and weather conditions to offer different dialogs, route hints and small command effects.",
    entityTypeId:"easy_npc:humanoid",
    modified:1782518400000L,
    name:"Skywatch Scout",
    variantType:"NOOR",
    version:"1.0.0"
  },
  data:{
    ActionData:{
      ActionEventSet:{
        ON_DISTANCE_CLOSE:[{
          Cmd:"/playsound minecraft:block.note_block.chime master @initiator ~ ~ ~ 0.6 1.2",
          Type:"COMMAND"
        }],
        ON_INTERACTION:[{
          Type:"OPEN_DEFAULT_DIALOG"
        }]
      },
      ActionPermissionLevel:4
    },
    ArmorDropChances:[0.085f,0.085f,0.085f,0.085f],
    ArmorItems:[{
      Count:1b,id:"minecraft:leather_boots",tag:{
        Damage:0
      }
    },{},{},{}],
    Attributes:[{
      Base:0.5d,Name:"minecraft:generic.movement_speed"
    },{
      Base:1.0d,Name:"minecraft:generic.attack_damage"
    },{
      Base:16.0d,Name:"minecraft:generic.follow_range"
    }],
    Brain:{
      memories:{}
    },
    CanPickUpLoot:0b,
    CanUpdate:1b,
    CustomName:'{"color":"#78C7FF","text":"Mira, Skywatch Scout"}',
    CustomNameVisible:1b,
    DialogData:{
      DialogDataSet:[{
        Buttons:[{
          Actions:[{
            Cmd:"/summon firework_rocket ~ ~1 ~ {LifeTime:25,FireworksItem:{id:firework_rocket,Count:1,tag:{Fireworks:{Flight:1,Explosions:[{Type:1,Flicker:1,Trail:1,Colors:[I;2437522,11743532],FadeColors:[I;15790320]}]}}}}",
            Type:"COMMAND"
          },{
            Cmd:"storm_flare",Type:"OPEN_NAMED_DIALOG"
          }],
          Conditions:[{
            SubType:"PER_DAY",Type:"EXECUTION_LIMIT",Value:1
          }],
          Label:"button_storm_flare",
          Name:"Send one storm flare"
        },{
          Actions:[{
            Cmd:"storm_route",Type:"OPEN_NAMED_DIALOG"
          }],
          Label:"button_storm_route",
          Name:"Which path is safe?"
        }],
        Conditions:[{
          SubType:"THUNDER",Type:"WEATHER"
        }],
        Label:"storm",
        Name:"Storm Watch",
        Priority:40,
        Texts:[{
          Text:"Hear that, @initiator? Thunder rolls from the high ridge, not the valley.\\n\\nKeep iron tools low, avoid lonely trees and follow the stone lanterns until the storm spends its temper."
        }]
      },{
        Buttons:[{
          Actions:[{
            Cmd:"rain_route",Type:"OPEN_NAMED_DIALOG"
          }],
          Label:"button_rain_route",
          Name:"Read the muddy trail"
        }],
        Conditions:[{
          SubType:"RAIN",Type:"WEATHER"
        }],
        Label:"rain",
        Name:"Rain Watch",
        Priority:30,
        Texts:[{
          Text:"Rain makes the old paths honest, @initiator. Fresh tracks shine, loose gravel darkens and the safe road leaves fewer puddles than the shortcut."
        }]
      },{
        Buttons:[{
          Actions:[{
            Cmd:"night_route",Type:"OPEN_NAMED_DIALOG"
          }],
          Label:"button_night_route",
          Name:"Follow the star route"
        },{
          Actions:[{
            Cmd:"/particle minecraft:end_rod ~ ~2 ~ 0.35 0.2 0.35 0.02 18",
            Type:"COMMAND"
          },{
            Cmd:"star_signal",Type:"OPEN_NAMED_DIALOG"
          }],
          Label:"button_star_signal",
          Name:"Raise a quiet signal"
        }],
        Conditions:[{
          Operation:"GREATER_THAN_OR_EQUALS",Type:"TIME_OF_DAY",Value:13000
        }],
        Label:"night",
        Name:"Night Watch",
        Priority:20,
        Texts:[{
          Text:"The night is not empty, @initiator. See the three bright stars above the spruce line? Keep them over your left shoulder and you will circle the ravine instead of falling into it."
        }]
      },{
        Buttons:[{
          Actions:[{
            Cmd:"day_route",Type:"OPEN_NAMED_DIALOG"
          }],
          Label:"button_day_route",
          Name:"Ask for the daylight route"
        }],
        Conditions:[{
          Operation:"LESS_THAN",Type:"TIME_OF_DAY",Value:12000
        }],
        Label:"day",
        Name:"Day Watch",
        Priority:10,
        Texts:[{
          Text:"Clear light, good wind and no smoke on the horizon. If you travel now, @initiator, keep to the ridge until the river bends. The birch grove marks the safer descent."
        }]
      },{
        Label:"storm_flare",
        Name:"Storm Flare Sent",
        Priority:-1,
        Texts:[{
          Text:"A blue-white flare climbs through the rain. Anyone watching the road will know a traveler needs a weather window."
        }]
      },{
        Label:"storm_route",
        Name:"Stone Lantern Path",
        Priority:-1,
        Texts:[{
          Text:"Take the low road only until the first cracked lantern. After that, climb. Water gathers there fast and the second bridge likes to vanish when the thunder gets close."
        }]
      },{
        Label:"rain_route",
        Name:"Muddy Trail",
        Priority:-1,
        Texts:[{
          Text:"Look for grass that bends uphill. That means someone dragged a cart through recently. Follow it and you will find the sheltered pass before your boots give up."
        }]
      },{
        Label:"night_route",
        Name:"Star Route",
        Priority:-1,
        Texts:[{
          Text:"Walk until the moon touches the tallest pine, then turn right. If you hear water before you see mossy stone, you turned too early."
        }]
      },{
        Label:"star_signal",
        Name:"Quiet Signal",
        Priority:-1,
        Texts:[{
          Text:"Small lights drift upward and fade. Quiet enough for friends to notice, soft enough that trouble should keep walking."
        }]
      },{
        Label:"day_route",
        Name:"Ridge Route",
        Priority:-1,
        Texts:[{
          Text:"Use the ridge while the sun is high. You will see danger before it sees you, and the way down is easier once the birch shadows point east."
        }]
      },{
        Conditions:[{
          Type:"FALLBACK"
        }],
        Label:"fallback",
        Name:"Changing Light",
        Priority:0,
        Texts:[{
          Text:"The sky is between stories right now, @initiator. Give it a moment, then ask again; dusk and dawn both like to keep secrets."
        }]
      }],
      Type:"CUSTOM"
    },
    DisplayAttribute:[{
